# Example environment configuration
# Copy this to .env and adjust as needed

# ── Local development ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Flask runs on 7860. The Vite proxy (vite.config.ts) forwards /api/* to it.
VITE_API_URL=/api

# ── Production (Vercel / Netlify / any static host) ──────────────────────────
# Point directly at your HuggingFace Space backend URL.
# Replace with your actual Space URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://aniket-ux3-voice-clone-backend.hf.space/api
